, Inc. in the state of Delaware on June 8, 2015. In March 2021, we changed our name to Aytu BioPharma, Inc. Our common stock trades on the Nasdaq Capital Market LLC (the \u201cNasdaq\u201d) under the ticker symbol \u201cAYTU.\u201d Our principal office is located at 7900 East Union Avenue, Suite 920, Denver, Colorado 80237, and our telephone number is (720) 437-6580.","filed":"2026-09-22","text_path":"text/AYTU/0001437749-26-030908-business.txt","text_chars":26000}}